&lt;a class="digest-item-title" href="https://www.gsma.com/about-us/regions/north-america/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/GSMA-North-America-Private-Networks.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Exploring Private 5G Networks Through the Lens of MNOs&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;span class="digest-item-source"&gt;GSMA OnGo Alliance&lt;/span&gt;


TLDR An operator-side playbook for deploying Private 5G — requirements, the case for slicing, virtualization and edge computing, plus a step-by-step deployment guide.


Why read it A counterweight to vendor whitepapers: it frames Private 5G through MNO economics and operating models, which matters when designing slice management.


