&lt;a class="digest-item-title" href="https://www.mavenir.com/resources/white-paper-5g-core-operator-survey-2025-edition-scaling-5g-sa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;5G Core Operator Survey — 2025 Edition: Scaling 5G SA&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;span class="digest-item-source"&gt;Mavenir&lt;/span&gt;


TLDR An operator survey on the services, infrastructure, and operating models driving the scaling of Standalone 5G core networks.


Why read it A grounded view of what packet-core operators are actually standardizing — useful reality-check for the slice-management thesis.


&lt;span class="digest-tag"&gt;packet-core&lt;/span&gt;
