&lt;a class="digest-item-title" href="https://www.amdocs.com/insights/blog/how-ai-powered-digital-twins-are-driving-autonomous-telco-networks" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;How AI-Powered Digital Twins Are Driving Autonomous Telco Networks&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;span class="digest-item-source"&gt;Amdocs&lt;/span&gt;


TLDR Digital twins as a risk-free sandbox for telcos: what-if testing, predictive optimization, and the path to autonomous network operations.


Why read it A concrete vendor framing of the digital-twin + AI network-management loop that sits at the core of the research direction.


&lt;span class="digest-tag"&gt;digital-twin&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="digest-tag"&gt;autonomous-networks&lt;/span&gt;
