&lt;a class="digest-item-title" href="https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-irtf-nmrg-network-digital-twin-arch/09/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Network Digital Twin: Concepts and Reference Architecture&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;span class="digest-item-source"&gt;IETF&lt;/span&gt;


TLDR An IRTF working draft defining the concepts and reference architecture for network digital twins.


Why read it The standards-track definition of the exact concept under study — worth reading for the vocabulary and layering it proposes.


&lt;span class="digest-tag"&gt;digital-twin&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="digest-tag"&gt;standards&lt;/span&gt;

